      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, well, Ser Arisen! I see that you've agreed\nto handle the monster extermination request\nfor the Volden Large Tunnels!",
        "Jp" : "これはこれは、覚者さん！\n《ボルド大坑道》の魔物退治の件\n引き受けてくださるんですな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446173,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What a relief this is!\nThe redevelopment of the Volden Large Tunnels\nis a vital task that we cannot avoid.",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、助かります！\n《ボルド大坑道》の再開発はこのエリアにとって\n避けては通れない重大な課題でしてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482179,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As of late, rumors claim of a skeletal knight\nwandering the mines... They're saying,\n\"a glowing skull stares from the depths.\"\nIt's probably just skeletons or something.",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、骸骨騎士が坑内を歩いている――とか\n光るドクロが坑道の奥からこっちを見てた――とか\nおおかたスケルトンか何かだと思うんですけどねぇ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482181,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We need to address these strange rumors\ndiscouraging miners from coming in to work,\nas soon as possible.",
        "Jp" : "鉱員が集まらなくなる妙な噂は\n早めにどうにかしてしまわないといけません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482180,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Once word spreads that the problem has been\ntaken care of, the miners should return.\nWe're counting on you for this one!",
        "Jp" : "覚者さんがちゃんと退治してくださったと\n言えるようになれば、また鉱員も集まるでしょう\nここは一つ、よろしくお願いしますよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482182,
      "MsgType" : 0,
